      "locked": false,
      "text": "The core mental model:",
      "fontSize": 14.16853131862986,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The core mental model:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "8b4D_Xa9Rl5z6N7CfTdJp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50157.29190674452,
      "y": 11739.03711626319,
      "width": 686.4476928710938,
      "height": 15.86875507686544,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4a9eed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0RW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1582749073,
      "version": 191,
      "versionNonce": 1444970871,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773990117899,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.  Your JS runs on one thread  —  V8 Call Stack executes it  —  any blocking call would freeze everything",
      "fontSize": 13.223962564054535,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.  Your JS runs on one thread  —  V8 Call Stack executes it  —  any blocking call would freeze everything",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "qNc1h8usZr7X0IodKXeaS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50157.29190674452,
      "y": 11757.928491354694,
      "width": 687.33349609375,
      "height": 15.868755076865439,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#22c55e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0RX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 552074097,
      "version": 191,
      "versionNonce": 2067510649,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773990117899,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2.  I/O ops (fs, network) are handed off to libuv  —  OS handles them async  —  your code keeps running",
      "fontSize": 13.223962564054533,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2.  I/O ops (fs, network) are handed off to libuv  —  OS handles them async  —  your code keeps running",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "tQhMCiCP_q0SbsjQ6aYtl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50157.29190674452,
      "y": 11776.819866446202,
      "width": 782.6495971679688,
      "height": 15.86875507686544,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f59e0b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0RY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 639198545,
      "version": 191,
      "versionNonce": 798964375,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773990117899,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3.  When I/O finishes  —  callback queued  —  event loop picks it up between phases  —  microtasks (Promises) run first",
      "fontSize": 13.223962564054535,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3.  When I/O finishes  —  callback queued  —  event loop picks it up between phases  —  microtasks (Promises) run first",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
